OL,3,GNEWSAExtremist jailed over anti-migrant
OL,4,Aterror posts
OL,5,
OL,6,FA right-wing extremist who discussed
OL,7,F"killing migrants when they arrive on
OL,8,Ftheir boats" and shared a manifesto by
OL,9,FNorwegian mass killer Anders Breivik
OL,10,Fhas been jailed.
OL,12,FIvan Jennings, 46, from Stafford, was a
OL,13,Fmember of several extreme right-wing
OL,14,Fsocial media chat groups and had
OL,15,Fdiscussed how to put poisonous
OL,16,Fmushrooms in the food of Jews and
OL,17,FMuslims, Leicester Crown Court heard.
