OL,3,GNEWSAExtremist jailed over anti-migrant
OL,4,Aterror posts
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarlier this year, he admitted
OL,7,Fencouraging terrorism between 15 August
OL,8,Fand 14 November 2024 as well as
OL,9,Fdissemination of a terrorism
OL,10,Fpublication on 21 August 2024.
OL,12,FThe father-of-four, who also identified
OL,13,Fan event celebrating Pakistan's
OL,14,Findependence day as a potential target,
OL,15,Fwas jailed for five years and three
OL,16,Fmonths.
